# Matt Pocock skill output (applies to ALL repos via global ignore)
# - domain-modeling: CONTEXT.md / CONTEXT-MAP.md glossary + docs/adr/ decisions
# - wayfinder: docs/wayfinder/<slug>/ maps, tickets, research
# - issue-tracker/research: docs/T*.md Phabricator task scratch docs
# NOTE: CONTEXT.md and docs/adr/ are generic names also used outside these
# skills; this hides them in every repo, not just this one.
